<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>毎朝AIニュースまとめ | 今日の要点サクッと速報</title>
  <meta name="description" content="毎朝自動更新される最新AIニュースの要約サイト。通勤時間やスキマ時間にスマホで1分でキャッチアップ。">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1e293b">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --primary-light: #eff6ff;
      --accent-bg: #f1f5f9;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --tag-bg: #e0f2fe;
      --tag-text: #0369a1;
      --takeaway-bg: #fefce8;
      --takeaway-border: #facc15;
      --takeaway-text: #854d0e;
      --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #0f172a;
        --card-bg: #1e293b;
        --text: #f8fafc;
        --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        --primary: #38bdf8;
        --primary-light: #1e293b;
        --accent-bg: #334155;
        --border: #334155;
        --tag-bg: #0c4a6e;
        --tag-text: #7dd3fc;
        --takeaway-bg: #422006;
        --takeaway-border: #eab308;
        --takeaway-text: #fef08a;
        --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Hiragino Sans", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", Meiryo, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 16px 16px 40px;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 12px 4px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    }

    .badge-today {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      background-color: var(--primary-light);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .meta-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .card-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .card:active {
      transform: scale(0.99);
    }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: var(--tag-bg);
      color: var(--tag-text);
    }

    .source-name {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .bullets {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .bullets li {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      padding-left: 18px;
      position: relative;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .bullets li::before {
      content: "•";
      position: absolute;
      left: 4px;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .takeaway-box {
      background-color: var(--takeaway-bg);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--takeaway-border);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .takeaway-title {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--takeaway-text);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .takeaway-content {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--takeaway-text);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .card-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    }

    .source-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background-color: var(--accent-bg);
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .source-link:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 36px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="badge-today">毎朝自動配信 ☀️</div>
    <h1>AI News Daily Digest</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">通勤中・スキマ時間の1分で掴む最新動向</div>
    <div class="meta-bar">
      <span>更新日時: {{ updated_time }}</span>
      <span>厳選 {{ articles|length }} 本</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="card-list">
    {% for article in articles %}
    <article class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span class="tag">{{ article.tag }}</span>
        <span class="source-name">{{ article.source }}</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="card-title">{{ article.title_ja }}</h2>

      <ul class="bullets">
        {% for bullet in article.bullets %}
        <li>{{ bullet }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>

      {% if article.takeaway %}
      <div class="takeaway-box">
        <div class="takeaway-title">💡 ここがポイント</div>
        <div class="takeaway-content">{{ article.takeaway }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="card-footer">
        <a href="{{ article.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="source-link">
          元記事を読む →
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Powered by Google Gemini & GitHub Actions</p>
    <p>完全無料で毎朝自動生成・配信中</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
